{'symbol': 'ICE', 'date': '2020-12-17 09:15:00', 'title': 'ICE APPOINTED TO HOST UK EMISSIONS AUCTIONS FOR THE UK EMISSIONS TRADING SCHEME', 'text': "LONDON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--INTERCONTINENTAL EXCHANGE, INC. (NYSE:ICE), A LEADING OPERATOR OF GLOBAL EXCHANGES AND CLEARING HOUSES AND PROVIDER OF MORTGAGE TECHNOLOGY, DATA AND LISTINGS SERVICES, ANNOUNCES THAT ICE HAS BEEN APPOINTED TO HOST EMISSIONS AUCTIONS ON BEHALF OF THE UK GOVERNMENT'S DEPARTMENT FOR BUSINESS, ENERGY AND INDUSTRIAL STRATEGY (BEIS). AS ANNOUNCED ON DECEMBER 14, 2020, THE UK GOVERNMENT AND DEVOLVED ADMINISTRATIONS WILL LAUNCH A UK EMISSIONS TRADING SCHEME (UK ETS) FROM JANUAR"}